ub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}suc{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}sub{}s